style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l9 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Thanks to everyone who attended =
or helped contribute to the Yocto Summit, it seemed to be a success and =
had some good presentations!<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l9 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>There are a number of bitbake =
patches pending with an unresolved dilemma on functionality versus =
parsing speeds.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l9 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>CVEs in master have risen with =
7 across 5 components, help in bringing the numbers down would be =
appreciated<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l9 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We are starting to see some =
rough plans around Y2038, largefile support and some other topics, =
thanks to all those helping move this forward, there has been some =
useful discussion and we look forward to seeing the =
changes!<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l9 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We have a growing number of =
bugs in bugzilla, any help with them is =
appreciated.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l9 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>As people are likely aware, the =
project has a number of components which are either unmaintained, or =
have people with little to no time trying to keep them alive. These =
components include: patchtest, layerindex, devtool, toaster, wic, oeqa, =
autobuilder, CROPs containers, pseudo and more. Many have open bugs. =
Help is welcome in trying to better look after these =
components!<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p style=3D'margin:0in'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:black'>Ways to =
